        "x1": 0.9184558823529412,
        "y1": 0.7397891414141414
      },
      "text": "Now note that in our case, since S(ρS) = 1 and Q = Q1, it follows from Eqs. (5) and (7) that the quantum capacity is related to the entanglement-assisted classical capacity via the simple formula",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
